<title>USA: Carmel Container Q4 shr.</title>
<headline>Carmel Container Q4 shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carmel Container Systems Ltd.</p>
<p>			  Consolidated statement of income</p>
<p>			(Figures Adjusted to December 31, 1996)</p>
<p>					  YEAR ENDED</p>
<p>				 12/31/1995   12/31/1996  12/31/1996*</p>
<p>				 NI(000)     NI(000)	    US$-000</p>
<p> NET SALES			  374,650     363,373     111,773</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME		  35,974	32,614	10,032</p>
<p> NET INCOME			  17,493	13,350	 4,106</p>
<p> WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES    2,511,000   2,512,000   2,512,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER SHARE (NIS)	6.97	  5.31	  1.63</p>
<p>				     THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>				 12/31/1995   12/31/1996  12/31/1996*</p>
<p>				 NI(000)     NI(000)	    US$-000</p>
<p> NET SALES			  103,728	91,951	28,284</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME		   9,745	 6,256	 1,924</p>
<p> NET INCOME			   3,917	 2,150	   661</p>
<p> WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES    2,511,000   2,512,000   2,512,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER SHARE (NIS)	1.56	  0.86	  0.26</p>
<p>* The translation of New Israeli Shekels into U.S. Dollars is at the rate of NIS 3.251 to $1.00, the average rate of exchange on December 31. The company, traded on the American Stock Exchange, is based in Tel-Aviv, Israel.</p>
